+def lengau_claims_plan(fz):
+    """A well-formed plan holding Lengau's claims on the 47 EC2-designated replicates (the e2 claims snapshot, frozen): with the
+    13 Lengau replicates and e2's owned set (the hand-back) they cover S x 0..79, as on the real root."""
